(text "Fit one shunt on JP1. Default 1-2 = 3.3 V.\nCheck Hall sensor model before selecting 2-3 = 5 V." (at 20.32 267.97 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0b568592-4d1c-58c1-8493-b5559993fca3"))
(text "Use Nexperia 74LVC244AD. Inputs tolerate 5 V and have Schmitt action.\nUnused inputs are grounded; unused outputs are marked NC." (at 195.58 163.83 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "17b5aa56-afe1-59c1-97d9-bda6d6d3dc3d"))
(text "Speaker remains on the DAC SPK+ and SPK- outputs.\nNeither speaker wire connects to carrier GND.\nDAC I2C pullups are on the Adafruit module." (at 195.58 317.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9c9034b3-5c1d-5125-a86b-93692ce92ee5"))
(text "RST = 10k / 100nF delay through U3 Schmitt buffer.\nR10 = 100k for the LCD TXB0108. BL stays on.\nValidate buffered power-on reset on cold starts and fast cycles." (at 369.57 288.29 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f097ed77-9c3e-5103-8c3d-d9456147de45"))
(text "Carrier cable order is printed here. Trace each module's pin labels before connecting.\nHall tile positions are firmware order; trace the physical 3 x 3 panel before labeling cables.\nPico USB is the only power input. Measure total current with all voices and the display active.\nPICO_3V3 powers the LCD, potentiometer and buffers. AUX_3V3 powers SD and the selected Hall rail.\nU4 dissipates 0.51 W at 5 V input / 300 mA output. Verify regulator temperature inside the enclosure.\nThe 100 x 80 mm outline and mounting holes are provisional. Enclosure dimensions are unmeasured." (at 20.32 373.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1557e9ce-357d-5d46-84d7-dfefcdbc2cc4"))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))) (embedded_fonts no))
